# Keyboard input QA script
# Test navigation, W/S aliases, and modifier handling

Down    # Navigate down to Options
Up      # Navigate up to Quit
Up      # Navigate up to Options
Down    # Navigate down to Quit
Down    # Navigate down to New Game
w       # W should move up to Quit (character input)
W       # W (uppercase) should move up to Options (character input)
s       # s should move down to Quit (character input)
S       # S (uppercase) should move down to New Game (character input)
Esc     # Back action should do nothing on main menu
Enter   # Open New Game (map screen)
Esc     # Back to menu from map, should keep selection on New Game
